<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FBType Name="Q_SoftKeyMask" Comment="Command change soft key mask( Part 6 - F.36 )">
	<Identification Standard="ISO 11783-6" Description="Copyright (c) 2022 HR Agrartechnik GmbH  &#10; &#10;This program and the accompanying materials are made  &#10;available under the terms of the Eclipse Public License 2.0  &#10;which is available at https://www.eclipse.org/legal/epl-2.0/  &#10; &#10;SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0  &#10;   &#10;   &#10;see Description Tab">
	</Identification>
	<VersionInfo Organization="HR Agrartechnik GmbH" Version="1.0" Author="Franz Höpfinger" Date="2022-07-08">
	</VersionInfo>
	<CompilerInfo packageName="isobus::UT::Q">
		<Import declaration="isobus::UT::Q::const::IDs::ID_NULL"/>
	</CompilerInfo>
	<InterfaceList>
		<EventInputs>
			<Event Name="INIT" Type="EInit" Comment="Service Initialization">
				<With Var="QI"/>
			</Event>
			<Event Name="REQ" Type="Event" Comment="Service Request">
				<With Var="QI"/>
				<With Var="u16DataMaskId"/>
				<With Var="u16SoftKeyMaskId"/>
				<With Var="u8MaskType"/>
			</Event>
		</EventInputs>
		<EventOutputs>
			<Event Name="INITO" Type="EInit" Comment="Initialization Confirm">
				<With Var="QO"/>
			</Event>
			<Event Name="CNF" Type="Event" Comment="Confirmation of Requested Service">
				<With Var="QO"/>
				<With Var="STATUS"/>
				<With Var="s16result"/>
				<With Var="u16OldDataMaskId"/>
				<With Var="u16OldSoftKeyMaskId"/>
				<With Var="u8OldMaskType"/>
			</Event>
		</EventOutputs>
		<InputVars>
			<VarDeclaration Name="QI" Type="BOOL" Comment="Quality Input - TRUE to enable service" InitialValue="TRUE"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u8MaskType" Type="USINT" Comment="1 == Data, 2 == Alarm "/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16DataMaskId" Type="UINT" Comment="Object ID of active Mask " InitialValue="ID_NULL"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16SoftKeyMaskId" Type="UINT" Comment="Object ID of (new) soft key mask " InitialValue="ID_NULL"/>
		</InputVars>
		<OutputVars>
			<VarDeclaration Name="QO" Type="BOOL" Comment="Quality Output - TRUE if service executed successfully"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="STATUS" Type="STRING" Comment="Service Status"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u8OldMaskType" Type="USINT"/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OldDataMaskId" Type="UINT" Comment="Old object ID of active Mask "/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="u16OldSoftKeyMaskId" Type="UINT" Comment="Old object ID of (new) soft key mask "/>
			<VarDeclaration Name="s16result" Type="INT" Comment="retval see description"/>
		</OutputVars>
	</InterfaceList>
	<Attribute Name="Documentation" Type="CDATA"><![CDATA[<h1>Command change soft key mask( Part 6 - F.36 )</h1>

<p>This command is used to change the soft key mask associated with a data or alarm mask object.</p>

<h2>param[in] {type, uint8_t}</h2>

<p>1 == Data, 2 == Alarm</p>

<h2>param[in] {dataOrAlarmMaskObjectID, uint16_t}</h2>

<p>Object ID of active Mask</p>

<h2>param[in] {newSoftKeyMaskObjectID, uint16_t}</h2>

<p>Object ID of (new) soft key mask</p>

<h2>Valid values for u16DataMaskId (the data or alarm mask object)</h2>

<p>The Change Soft Key Mask command (Annex F.36) associates a Soft Key Mask with a Data Mask or an Alarm Mask. Valid if <code>u16DataMaskId</code> falls within one of the following ISO 11783-6 ID ranges:</p>
<ul>
	<li><strong>DataMask</strong>: 1000 – 1999</li>
	<li><strong>AlarmMask</strong>: 2000 – 2999</li>
</ul>

<h2>Valid values for u16SoftKeyMaskId (the soft key mask object)</h2>

<p>Valid if <code>u16SoftKeyMaskId</code> falls within the ISO 11783-6 ID range for a Soft Key Mask:</p>
<ul>
	<li><strong>SoftKeyMask</strong>: 4000 – 4999</li>
</ul>

<p>ID_NULL (65535) is not a command target but can be used in INIT to deactivate the FB. Any data/alarm mask ID outside the ranges above, or any soft key mask ID that is not a SoftKeyMask, is invalid for commanding — independent of each other.</p>

<h2>Return Values (s16result):</h2>

<h3>int16_t</h3>

<ul>
	<li><span style="color:#27ae60">VT_E_NO_ERR (0)</span> - OK</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NOT_READY (-131)</span> - VT client not yet ready</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_OVERFLOW (-6)</span> - buffer overflow</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NOACT (-8)</span> - Command not possible in current state</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NO_INSTANCE (-21)</span> - No VT client available</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_ISO_INSTANCE_INVALID (-129)</span> - Identifier for instance (connection) invalid</li>
	<li><span style="color:#e74c3c">VT_E_NOT_ALIVE (-130)</span> - Identifier for instance valid, but VT Dead.</li>
	<li><span style="color:#2980b9">VT_OK_BUFFERED (18)</span> - command buffered, waiting for VT to be ready</li>
</ul>
<h2>Instanz-Eindeutigkeit (Instance Uniqueness)</h2>

<p>Dieser Baustein ist konzeptionell als Singleton (genau eine Instanz im gesamten Programm) vorgesehen.</p>
]]></Attribute>
	<Attribute Name="eclipse4diac::core::TypeHash" Value="''"/>
</FBType>
